  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-slack/src/operations/get-slack-channels.ts#conversationKind]
  note: |
    No `ConversationKind` schema or union exists in `src/`. `conversationKind` derives a plain-text label
    ('channel', 'private channel', 'group', 'direct message', 'group direct message') from the `is_*` flags
    and writes it into `RemoteTarget.description`.
```

