```mdl
verdict F-3.4: A failed binding records lastError and siblings finish, but the operation then fails instead of returning a result.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-slack/src/operations/sync.ts, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-connector/src/Binding.ts#syncAll]
  note: |
    `Cursor.recordError` writes the readable string from `formatSlackSyncFailure`. `syncAll` collects
    every binding's outcome and then `Effect.fail`s with the first failure, so the caller gets no
    `pulled` result. Untested.
```

